OL,3,AApple Maps changes Lake Ontario to Lake
OL,4,AAmerica after Trump order
OL,5,
OL,6,FApple has renamed Lake Ontario as Lake
OL,7,FAmerica on its maps service app, after
OL,8,Fan order from US President Donald Trump
OL,9,Fas part of Washington's trade spat with
OL,10,FCanada.
OL,12,FThe change was made for US-based users,
OL,13,Fwhile those in Canada will continue to
OL,14,Fsee Lake Ontario displayed. The BBC has
OL,15,Fcontacted Apple for comment.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788311955
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AApple Maps changes Lake Ontario to Lake
OL,4,AAmerica after Trump order
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe iPhone maker's move follows Trump's
OL,7,Fexecutive order to change the lake's
OL,8,Fname after trade talks between the
OL,9,Fneighbouring countries collapsed late
OL,10,Flast month, with Washington imposing
OL,11,Fnew 50% tariffs on $20bn (#14.8bn;
OL,12,FC$28bn) worth of Canadian goods.
OL,14,FGoogle made a similar switch for its
OL,15,Fusers in the US in recent days, leading
OL,16,Fto backlash on social media.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
